JTech YouTube Ad Blocker
Copyright (c) JTech. Licensed under the MIT License (see the LICENSE file of JTech Browser).

This extension is an independent implementation. It uses publicly known approaches such as
removing ad fields (adPlacements, playerAds, adSlots) from YouTube API responses and
fast-forwarding ads that still play, as described in open source projects and filter
lists. No code from other projects and no GPL-licensed code is included.
